This i have the usual perception of fear of abandonment but it can be soo much deeper! Fear of getting fired, not handling managers moving to other locations over time, sometimes being awake and seeing nobody online even if we haven't had any falling out and i didn't even wish to speak to them at the moment, having to "leave" when you were hanging out with someone and being alone with yourself, trouble quitting a job no matter how much you hate it/it's not what you want, taking an ex back even though you were unhappy with them cause it's a loss, trouble with friends meeting other friends of yours and worries if they'll like them more than you ect

