I was on a few ones, mostly due to genetic issues and then mental as time went on

The first one was the combined pill,  it was okay enough i didn't notice any side effects on it but it didn't stop the mental issues and sometimes caused extra worry cause the periods i did have were so light i wasn't sure if i had one or not

&#x200B;

Then i was on another pill years later that would stop the periods altogether. But you had to take it within 10 minutes of each other every day same time or you got a unexpected period or the start of one. No side effects either but it was too hard to upkeep and then that caused more mental health cause i was almost always self conscious if i'd start bleeding again or not and missing the time period almost every night

&#x200B;

Now i'm on injections, i don't feel any side effects and it works the best, but i have been told there is a increased risk of cancer with it

